# Tailscale auth for the ts-mealie node, which joins as tag:funnel. Either:
#   - a non-ephemeral pre-auth key tagged tag:funnel (tskey-auth-...), or
#   - an OAuth client secret with auth_keys write scope that owns tag:funnel,
#     suffixed with ?ephemeral=false (tskey-client-...?ephemeral=false)
# Only used on first join; the node identity then lives in the ts-state volume.
TS_AUTHKEY=
